values ('sages-question-suta', (select id from works where slug='bhagavata-purana'), 'The sages of Naimiṣāraṇya question Sūta', 'नैमिषीयाणां सूतं प्रति प्रश्नः', 'Framing narrative of the whole Bhāgavata. At a thousand-year sacrifice in Naimiṣāraṇya, Śaunaka and the sages honour Sūta and ask him to distil the essence of all scripture: what is the ultimate good for people in the age of Kali, and what became of dharma after Kṛṣṇa''s departure.',
